      "value": "The proposer is the Topaz Chat provider listed in the Allowlisted Service https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/video-players/www-whitelist/\n\nHe have been providing RTSP servers for VRChat for many years, and there is no doubt that he tested that.",
