      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Some testing in the following linked feature request has revealed that rtsp udp can go through a NAT, if the client sends some udp packets first\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/implement-libvlc-or-similar-for-vrchat-video-players-current-solutions-are-nothi",
      "viewerReactions": null,
